46 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(A story about friendship, genetics, and appreciating human differences rather than letting them get in the way of what truly matters.)/E(A story about friendship, genetics, and appreciating human differences rather than letting them get in the way of what truly matters.)/Alt()/Pg 8 0 R/K[1]>>
