71 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(     Amanda took a deep breath, walked up to the girl with green-streaked hair, and gave her a friendly wave. \215Hi! I\220m Amanda.\216      \215Nice to meet you,\216 the girl grinned back at her. \215I\220m Zoe.\216      \215I like your hair,\216 said Amanda.      \215Thanks! Green is my favourite colour,\216 replied Zoe.      \215Green is my favourite colour too!\216)/E(     Amanda took a deep breath, walked up to the girl with green-streaked hair, and gave her a friendly wave. \215Hi! I\220m Amanda.\216      \215Nice to meet you,\216 the girl grinned back at her. \215I\220m Zoe.\216      \215I like your hair,\216 said Amanda.      \215Thanks! Green is my favourite colour,\216 replied Zoe.      \215Green is my favourite colour too!\216)/Alt()/Pg 19 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

