<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(     The two girls laughed. And suddenly, it didn\220t seem so complicated. Amanda had already found a similarity with Zoe. Even though they were different, in some ways, they were also the same.       Amanda smiled to herself. Maybe she could make a best friend that was just like her after all.)/E(     The two girls laughed. And suddenly, it didn\220t seem so complicated. Amanda had already found a similarity with Zoe. Even though they were different, in some ways, they were also the same.       Amanda smiled to herself. Maybe she could make a best friend that was just like her after all.)/Alt()/Pg 20 0 R/K[1]>>
