<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Emily Leha is a student at Western University originally from Ottawa, Ontario. Inspired by the diverse world around her, she wrote this story to help children see that we are all more alike than we realize. When not studying hard for an upcoming Medical Sciences test, she enjoys reading,  tennis, playing the flute and piano, and traveling.)/Alt()/Pg 22 0 R/K[6]>>
